    <description><![CDATA[<p><b><span>本期节目录制于：2023年12月26日</span></b></p><p><b><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/4c91-audiofreehighqps/C6/2C/GKwRIJEJZU4lACnb_QKUT_3a.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></b></p><br><p><span>在本期节目中，你将会听到以下的话题：</span></p><p><span>1.三位主持蛇形选秀，挑出各自心仪的史上最强先发五人 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a></span></p><p><span>2.模仿Doc Rivers的大烟嗓 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a></span></p><p><span>3.拼凑一份「篮球最强要素合成怪」<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="719">11:59</a></span></p><p><span>4.NBA答题环节 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a></span></p><p><span>A. NBA哪支球队打过最多圣诞大战的？</span></p><p><span>B. NBA哪支球队从来没打过圣诞大战？</span></p><p><span>C. 职业生涯里在圣诞大战总得分前四的现役球员？</span></p><p><span>D. 以下这三位球员有什么共同点？Chris Boucher, Reggie Bullock, Trey Murphy III</span></p><p><span>E. 现役球员中，抢断总数排前五的的球员</span></p><p><span>F. 2022-2023赛季两双数量最多的十位球员</span></p><p><span>G. 2022-2023赛季抢断总数最多的5位球员</span></p><p><span>H. 讲出所有在迈阿密热火效力过的球员</span></p><br><p><span>[MATT]</span></p><p><span>Michael Jordan (1)</span></p><p><span>Steph Curry (6)</span></p><p><span>Kareem Abdul-Jabbar (7)</span></p><p><span>Dirk Nowitzki（12）</span></p><p><span>Lebron James(13)</span></p><p><span>Coach: Brad Stevens (18)</span></p><br><p><span>[ANDREW]</span></p><p><span>Shaq O’neal (2)</span><br><span>Kobe Bryant (5)</span></p><p><span>Allen Iverson (8)</span></p><p><span>Kevin Garnett (11)</span><br><span>Kevin Durant（14）</span></p><p><span>Coach: Phil Jackson (17)</span></p><br><p><span>[BARNEY]</span><br><span>Tim Duncan (3)</span></p><p><span>Nikola Jokic (4)</span></p><p><span>Larry Bird (9)</span></p><p><span>Kawhi Leonard (10)</span></p><p><span>Magic Johnson (15)</span></p><p><span>Coach: Erik Spoelstra (16)</span></p><br><p><span>[BARNEY‘s 篮球科学坏人]</span></p><p><span>· 库里的投篮</span></p><p><span>· 乔丹的身体素质</span></p><p><span>· 约基奇的传球</span></p><p><span>· 艾弗森的运球</span></p><p><span>· JR史密斯的篮球IQ&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>· SGA的文学素养</span></p><br><p><span>[MATT‘s 篮球科学坏人]</span></p><p><span>· 欧文的运球</span></p><p><span>· 卡特的弹跳力</span></p><p><span>· 诺维斯基的进攻包</span></p><p><span>· 文班亚马的身高</span></p><p><span>· 詹姆斯的抗伤能力</span></p><p><span>· 追梦+基迪+普里莫的素养</span></p><br><p><span>[ANDREW‘s 篮球科学坏人]</span></p><p><span>· 白巧克力的传球</span></p><p><span>· 韦德的终结能力</span></p><p><span>· 艾弗森的抢断</span></p><p><span>· 罗斯的突破</span></p><p><span>· 以赛托马斯的身高</span></p><p><span>· 詹姆斯的羞耻心</span></p><br><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/1e8b-audiofreehighqps/27/14/GKwRIJEJZU_gAAB-zgKUUP4H.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><br><p><span>Fancy Fantasy现已入驻Mianbao FM</span></p><p><span><a data-url="https://mianbao.fm/podcast/fantasy" href="https://mianbao.fm/podcast/fantasy">mianbao.fm</a></span></p><br><p><span>欢迎各大播客平台订阅收听！</span></p><p><span>对于本期节目有任何看法吗？欢迎留言给予你的观点！</span></p><br><br><br><br>]]></description>
